# Injection Locking Model
--- Netlist
lambda n: 0 --> t_ref
t_ref, t_out_down_uncorr --> sub --> delta_t_err
delta_t_err --> scaler(beta) --> tf([1,0],[1,-1],1) --> t_corr
t_corr --> delay(1) --> t_corr_delay
t_corr --> up_zoh(N) --> t_corr_up_zoh
t_corr_up_zoh, t_osc --> add --> t_out
lambda n: np.random.randn()*1e-15 --> osc_period_jitter
osc_period_jitter --> integrator --> t_osc
t_osc --> down_sampler(N) --> t_osc_down
t_osc_down, t_corr_delay --> add --> t_out_down_uncorr
